### Minecraft Modding ###
run/
!**/src/**/run/
# Loom and ModDevGradle name their dev-run directories "runs" (fabric/runs, neoforge/runs).
# Without this they would be committed: game logs, saved worlds and dev config files.
runs/
!**/src/**/runs/
**/src/generated/**/.cache/
repo/
!**/src/**/repo/
